---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
  { name: 'Privacy', path: '/privacy/' },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Main Sequence Guide"
  description="How Main Sequence Guide handles data, hosting logs, localStorage tools, external links and potential third-party advertising, including Adsterra."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
  pageType="WebPage"
>
  <PageIntro
    eyebrow="Privacy"
    title="Privacy policy"
    description="What this site does with data, what it deliberately does not collect, and how local browser tools are handled."
    breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
    meta={['Effective November 1, 2026', 'No account system', 'Ad script currently disabled']}
  />

  <div class="wrap py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="prose-guide max-w-3xl">
      <p class="font-mono text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-mist">
        Effective date: {SITE.lastVerifiedLabel}
      </p>

      <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
      <p>
        Main Sequence Guide is an independent editorial website at{' '}
        {SITE.url.replace('https://', '')}. It is not affiliated with Tumbling
        Dumpling Studio, Mythwright or Valve. Privacy questions can be sent to{' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Data we collect directly</h2>
      <p>
        The site has no accounts, comments, checkout or newsletter signup. We do
        not ask for your name, address or payment details. If you email us, we
        receive the address and message you send, and we use it to answer or
        correct the site.
      </p>

      <h2>Hosting and logs</h2>
      <p>
        The site is served by Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare and its network may
        process technical information such as IP address, user agent, request
        path and security signals to deliver the site, prevent abuse and
        maintain reliability. Those processing activities are governed by
        Cloudflare’s privacy terms. We do not operate a separate visitor
        analytics profile in the current build.
      </p>

      <h2>Local browser tools</h2>
      <p>
        The demo checklist stores checkbox state in your browser’s local storage
        so it can show progress when you return. This information stays on your
        device. It is not transmitted to the site owner and it does not
        synchronise across devices. You can reset it with the on-page reset
        button or by clearing site data in your browser.
      </p>
      <p>
        The co-op crew planner runs in the page and does not store or submit the
        allocations. The countdown reads the current time in your browser. No
        account is required.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising and Adsterra</h2>
      <p>
        The current build does not load advertising scripts. The site is
        prepared to support clearly labelled display advertising through
        Adsterra if a live placement is configured in a future build. If that
        happens, the third-party ad provider may use cookies, local storage,
        device information and IP address to serve, cap, measure or protect ads.
        Those activities are controlled by Adsterra and its partners, not by
        this site.
      </p>
      <p>
        Before advertising is enabled in a way that requires consent, we expect
        to add an appropriate consent mechanism for the relevant regions and to
        update this policy with the active provider details. If advertising is
        never enabled, the ad script remains absent.
      </p>
      <p>
        Adsterra’s own privacy information is available at{' '}
        <a href="https://adsterra.com/privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          adsterra.com/privacy-policy
        </a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
      <p>
        This site’s code uses local storage for the checklist, not advertising
        cookies. Cloudflare may set security-related cookies for abuse
        prevention. If third-party advertising is enabled, additional cookies or
        local storage may be set by the ad provider; the consent banner and
        provider disclosures would apply at that time.
      </p>

      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        Links to Steam, the official game site, YouTube, Steam Community,
        Adsterra and other sites are provided for reference. Once you leave this
        site, the destination’s own privacy policy applies. We do not control
        those sites.
      </p>

      <h2>Legal bases and rights</h2>
      <p>
        Where applicable law provides rights such as access, correction,
        deletion, objection or portability, you can contact us using the address
        above. Because this site does not maintain an account database, we may
        need enough information to identify the relevant correspondence or rely
        on the hosting provider for server-side records. You may also have the
        right to complain to your local data protection authority.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not sell personal information. The site is not directed to
        children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their personal data.
      </p>

      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p>
        Email correspondence is retained only as long as needed to handle the
        request and keep an accurate correction record. Hosting logs are
        retained according to the hosting provider’s settings and policies.
        Browser localStorage remains until you clear it or reset the checklist.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        If the site adds analytics, a new host, active advertising or a contact
        form, this policy will be updated and the effective date changed. A
        privacy policy update is not a claim that the game or its data changed.
      </p>

      <div class="callout callout-info">
        <span class="callout-title">Plain-language summary</span>
        <p class="m-0">
          No accounts. No newsletter. The checklist stays in your browser.
          Cloudflare handles hosting. Ads are currently off; if they turn on, a
          third-party ad provider may process ad-related data and this policy
          will be updated with the active setup.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
